### TRANSACTIONS
### GET
### Geral
GET https://localhost:8080/transactions
### Por categoria de gasto
GET https://localhost:8080/transactions/{category}
### Por intervalo de datas
GET https://localhost:8080/transactions/{startDate}&{endDate}

### POST
POST https://localhost:8080/transactions

